h the ICO</li></ul><br>Each game scenario has a special research goal related to the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customize your character<br></li><li> Set dress code for employees<br></li><li> Use whichever currency you like ($, GBP, EUR, RUB, CNY\u2026)<br></li><li> Imperial and metric system supported</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304990/extras/bd421941c7af1592ba8c915c160a884a.poster.avif?t=1730796355\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304990/extras/bd421941c7af1592ba8c915c160a884a.gif?t=1730796355\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>What are you waiting for? <br><br>The best time to start mining was 10 years ago.",
